The lookup fails because the request pathname includes the `base` path prefix (e.g., `/docs/`) while build output paths are relative to the project root. Use `app.removeBase(pathname)` to strip the configured `base` before resolving filesystem paths.

```ts
import { createApp } from 'astro/app/entrypoint';
const app = createApp();
export async function handler(event) {
  const pathname = app.removeBase(new URL(event.request.url).pathname);
  // Use pathname for filesystem resolution
}
